## Purpose

Stores the origin of incoming applications. A source can represent an agency, referral partner, website form, email inbox, social media campaign, API integration, recruiter, or any other channel that submits applicants into the system.

Instead of repeating source information for every applicant, the system stores it once and links each application through a foreign key. This enables centralized source management and reporting.

